    "title": "The MCP is a route inside backoffice-service",
    "desc": "Claude Code or Podium gets a token from the authorization server and calls the /mcp route on backoffice-service. The route runs the existing tRPC procedures in-process as the staff member; they write the audit row, change PostHog flags and start RMPO DAG runs.",
